<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1764509569"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:11.176"><div begin="18.144" end="33.345" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="18.144" end="21.343" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.144" end="21.051">站在伞下看着多少路人甲</span><span begin="21.051" end="21.343">乙</span></p><p begin="21.800" end="25.301" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.800" end="23.223">带着冻伤想想</span><span begin="23.223" end="24.974">过去不过如此而</span><span begin="24.974" end="25.301">已</span></p><p begin="25.668" end="29.196" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.668" end="28.947">我们两人之间似乎不敌这场风</span><span begin="28.947" end="29.196">景</span></p><p begin="29.434" end="33.345" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.434" end="30.902">这一次有点僵</span> <span begin="30.902" end="32.850">我无力了 修不好自</span><span begin="32.850" end="33.345">己</span></p></div><div begin="33.438" end="49.583" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="33.438" end="37.098" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.438" end="34.078">反正</span><span begin="34.078" end="34.989">那些对的</span> <span begin="34.989" end="36.814">曾经可能终于错</span><span begin="36.814" end="37.098">了</span></p><p begin="37.380" end="41.101" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.380" end="37.982">于是</span><span begin="37.982" end="40.764">为什么我回答 什么都嫌多</span><span begin="40.764" end="41.101">了</span></p><p begin="41.425" end="44.915" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.425" end="41.945">你别</span><span begin="41.945" end="44.396">怕我只会在老远里想念</span><span begin="44.396" end="44.915">了</span></p><p begin="45.121" end="49.583" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.121" end="47.703">但也许你 嫌一公里还是太</span><span begin="47.703" end="48.040">接</span><span begin="48.040" end="48.326">近</span><span begin="48.326" end="49.583">呢</span></p></div><div begin="50.394" end="1:02.682" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="50.394" end="55.443" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.394" end="52.734">我正在准备坐上飞机</span><span begin="52.734" end="53.253">要</span><span begin="53.253" end="53.489">往</span><span begin="53.489" end="53.926">北</span><span begin="53.926" end="54.461">方而</span><span begin="54.461" end="55.443">去</span></p><p begin="56.013" end="1:02.682" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.013" end="56.358">我</span><span begin="56.358" end="56.683">听</span><span begin="56.683" end="57.176">过</span><span begin="57.176" end="57.463">永</span><span begin="57.463" end="58.180">夜</span> <span begin="58.180" end="58.493">没</span><span begin="58.493" end="59.168">问</span><span begin="59.168" end="59.496">题</span> <span begin="59.496" end="1:00.405">我想</span><span begin="1:00.405" end="1:02.682">去</span></p></div><div begin="1:02.997" end="1:33.325" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:02.997" end="1:10.956" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.997" end="1:04.619">去北极</span><span begin="1:04.619" end="1:05.115">忘</span><span begin="1:05.115" end="1:05.335">记</span><span begin="1:05.335" end="1:06.057">你</span> <span begin="1:06.057" end="1:06.362">可</span><span begin="1:06.362" end="1:07.037">不</span><span begin="1:07.037" end="1:07.315">可</span><span begin="1:07.315" end="1:07.898">以</span> <span begin="1:08.198" end="1:08.458">从</span><span begin="1:08.458" end="1:08.996">此</span><span begin="1:08.996" end="1:09.455">隐</span><span begin="1:09.455" end="1:09.940">姓</span><span begin="1:09.940" end="1:10.257">埋</span><span begin="1:10.257" end="1:10.956">名</span></p><p begin="1:11.287" end="1:18.865" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.287" end="1:11.863">往</span><span begin="1:11.863" end="1:12.303">南</span><span begin="1:12.303" end="1:12.870">看</span><span begin="1:12.870" end="1:13.176">回</span><span begin="1:13.176" end="1:13.919">去</span> <span begin="1:14.136" end="1:14.396">唯</span><span begin="1:14.396" end="1:14.893">一</span><span begin="1:14.893" end="1:15.141">看</span><span begin="1:15.141" end="1:16.088">似</span> 