 end="1:55.455">哪</span><span begin="1:55.455" end="1:55.806">里</span></p><p begin="1:56.136" end="1:59.796" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.136" end="1:56.704">谁爱</span><span begin="1:56.704" end="1:57.121">要</span> <span begin="1:57.121" end="1:58.611">别客气就把它</span><span begin="1:58.611" end="1:58.871">拿</span><span begin="1:58.871" end="1:59.166">回</span><span begin="1:59.166" end="1:59.796">去</span></p></div><div begin="2:01.255" end="2:14.463" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="2:01.255" end="2:06.136" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.255" end="2:03.555">我现在真的很累于是</span><span begin="2:03.555" end="2:03.992">要</span><span begin="2:03.992" end="2:04.289">去</span><span begin="2:04.289" end="2:04.790">无</span><span begin="2:04.790" end="2:05.296">声旅</span><span begin="2:05.296" end="2:06.136">行</span></p><p begin="2:06.837" end="2:14.463" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.837" end="2:07.206">没</span><span begin="2:07.206" end="2:07.482">看</span><span begin="2:07.482" end="2:08.008">过</span><span begin="2:08.008" end="2:08.256">永</span><span begin="2:08.256" end="2:08.924">远</span> <span begin="2:08.924" end="2:09.329">没</span><span begin="2:09.329" end="2:09.943">错</span> <span begin="2:09.943" end="2:10.291">我</span><span begin="2:10.291" end="2:11.301">不懂</span><span begin="2:11.301" end="2:14.463">你</span></p></div><div begin="2:13.822" end="2:45.028" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:13.822" end="2:21.741" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.822" end="2:15.444">去北极</span><span begin="2:15.444" end="2:15.940">忘</span><span begin="2:15.940" end="2:16.160">记</span><span begin="2:16.160" end="2:16.882">你</span> <span begin="2:16.882" end="2:17.187">可</span><span begin="2:17.187" end="2:17.862">不</span><span begin="2:17.862" end="2:18.140">可</span><span begin="2:18.140" end="2:18.723">以</span> <span begin="2:19.023" end="2:19.283">从</span><span begin="2:19.283" end="2:19.821">此</span><span begin=